<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He loved them to the uttermost,</l><l>He washed His loved ones feet,</l><l>Produced this pleasant atmosphere</l><l>Where all the saints can meet;</l><l>His fragrant love has filled the room,</l><l>The service of our dear Bridegroom,</l><l>Jesus the Savior purifies His bride.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
